tion><p><strong><span>一、学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpw4n1HlMpzFd6C7qRlmL3SKJRia4qSrsu2Gxh6BVef9GWwPuGUJ3IibZ5Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>浙江师范大学心理学院拥有应用心理学国家一流本科专业建设点、心理学一级学科博士点、博士后流动站及全国首个教师教育神经科学交叉学科博士点。师资队伍汇聚国务院特殊津贴专家、国家级人才计划青年学者等高层次人才，形成“教授领衔—青年骨干—博士后协作”的梯队结构。建有教育部虚拟教研室、3门国家级一流课程和5门省级精品课程。拥有省级文科重点实验室“浙江省儿童青少年心理健康与危机干预智能实验室”“浙江省心理学实验教学示范中心”等省部级科研教学平台，配备包括功能性核磁共振、近红外脑功能成像仪、128导脑电仪、生物信号处理系统、眼动仪等在内的先进仪器和设备，总价值超过4100万元。在教师教育神经科学、信任研究与家庭教育心理、预防自杀与心理危机干预等领域形成鲜明特色。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、接收专业及方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）硕士：</span></strong></p><p><span>招生专业：040200心理学</span></p><p><span>研究方向：</span></p><p><span>1.基础心理学</span></p><p><span>2.发展与教育心理学</span></p><p><span>3.应用心理学</span></p><p><span>招生专业：045400应用心理</span></p><p><span>研究方向：</span></p><p><span>1.心理健康与心理咨询</span></p><p><span>2.家庭教育与社区心理服务</span></p><p><span>3.心理测量与大数据分析</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）直博：</span></strong></p><p><span>招生专业：040200心理学</span></p><p><span>研究方向：</span></p><p><span>1.教育心理学</span></p><p><span>2.发展认知神经科学</span></p><p><span>3.健康与社会心理学</span></p><p><span>4.教师教育神经科学</span></p><p><span><span>备注：</span>录取后按报名时所填研究方向进行培养。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、导师代表介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwBsic33zrwTJb1dbczBJKib3fpnOFRNK7Aiann4NQlxQgMicmkS8XrqyY4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>李伟健，二级教授、博士生导师，专注于教师教育神经科学、元认知与共情以及家庭教育指导与心理健康教育等领域研究。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpweFI0l5D0UU5zZjHn57jHkfKicK6x9ZVNdB1ommAygov3cz6ic18F83kg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>乐国安，教授、博士生导师，曾任教育部高等学校心理学教学指导委员会委员、中国心理学会理事长，发表学术论文200余篇，出版著作50余部。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpw47wicVYicIibDroog5ZytSMOLOyWKib2EqZL3jarvJ1PRvQF5LqTpJy5iaw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>周晓林，教授、博士生导师。华东师范大学心理与认知科学学院院长，研究领域包括语言认知、注意选择与执行控制、决策与神经经济学、社会认知与实验社会心理学等。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwmH5xZWpKoTGVKMdUWQravy97HgAA0YrdgkTxQEtsYgpncKDyjpmhHQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>孙炳海，教授、博士生导师、国家重大人才项目青年学者。曾先后获国家级和省级教学成果奖15项，专注于教师教育神经科学和应用社会心理学研究。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpw5N81Wtia0JtFYibxnXYJicicUAQJ4aficLGKTLWOpib5bIAvu56kRNriaIpww/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>汪俊，教授、博士生导师，入选浙江省海外高层次人才计划创新长期等人才项目。研究方向为情绪与社会认知、自闭症认知与脑机制。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwyicwNDrOjbm5zuwHoC4ZBb3pW5OI9HYhURicLZOQm9pZg86L3SuwRYnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>贾磊，副教授、硕士生导师，浙江省之江青年学者。主持国家级科研项目2项，主要从事社会认知与情绪心理研究。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwuXLg7MBcsmYDhScKc5FduxicYBueicA40C5P73icTUNutLqkJSsU1WOlw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>谢瑞波，教授、硕士生导师。专注青少年心理健康与家庭教育心理学研究，主持国家级省部级课题4项，在Child Development、心理学报等SSCI/CSSCI权威期刊发表论文100余篇。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpw5rUvaZaQiaumUDjVD3CRiaESFJgSDA6YIdVgKnFuZEGSnWhLDjic0cpww/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>李新宇，教授、博士生导师，现任浙江师范大学应用社会心理中心副主任。研究领域包括工作记忆、元认知、注意等认知加工过程及其应用。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwsn9zjpXlhC2KyXcicuM7fqickttq6UxMxKPzWwiawMzuhicicOAk8RNuriaw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>詹沛达，副教授、硕士生导师，浙江省高校领军人才青年优秀人才，浙江省之江青年拔尖人才，《心理科学》《应用心理学》等期刊编委。专注于基于潜变量的行为与认知建模和AI+心理与教育测评研究。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwhJiaHJaE1Fg4TFMGvRtibAFFjf1ubYoDicZBZgFYNTZ5knBUHnTlH13rg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>褚晓伟，副教授、硕士生导师。先后主持国家社科基金2项，主要从事青少年网络心理与行为领域的研究。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwtTQWwibUPoesCJoRecQPibwCFxnazPQBDkA6N1yy7sHeCvKahojFceng/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>王志寰，副教授、硕士生导师，中国心理学会注册系统督导师，台湾医事人员临床心理师、咨商心理师。著作曾获省级优良教材奖。从事睡眠障碍、心理病理、心理治疗相关实践与研究。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpww4iaJBfpvQNuNxSoibOzy9qVPAnxmvshstgg3haeiaCdySF6JE0L9DzlA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>叶群，副教授、硕士生导师，多伦多大学博士后研究员。主持国家自然科学基金等项目，出版译著《人类神经影像学》。专注于元认知与情景记忆的核心机制及其应用前景。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>其余导师信息请参阅心理学院网站“师资队伍”栏：https://xlxy.zjnu.edu.cn/zrjs/list.htm</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、奖助政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学校建立多元奖助体系，设有国家奖学金、学业奖学金、在校生出国（境）交流奖学金等，实行国家助学金、国家助学贷款、“三助”津贴、专项帮困补助等制度，设立优秀学位论文培育、创新成果奖励、科研基金、创新创业项目培育、博士生助研津贴等专项经费，提高研究生待遇水平，支持研究生更好完成学业。各类奖助学金申请资格、资助额度和发放办法以学校最新公布文件为准。</span></p><p><span>本科直博生入学后即为博士生身份，基本学习年限为6年，其培养分两个阶段：前两年为第一阶段，国家助学金、学业奖学金按学术学位硕士生标准执行；中期考核合格后进入第二阶段，时间为4年，国家助学金、学业奖学金按学术学位博士生标准执行。助研津贴全程按照博士研究生标准执行。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、申请条件及流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请条件及流程等信息详见《浙江师范大学2026年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）招生章程》（https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IN8UqJLf_S2aG7ZqjWkSqQ）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VkgOIjKMqPHYsdJ2F4R5NamNMk0BcQpwdqowxAweiceYKFdF1zpKNDRTUuDf1icE3kFEM2D0KuP315UpaRibAib45Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><span></span><span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"17578d53a6b01156579d7a6122064e1ec630ea7cf93792ee2d62f988e401b725","textLength":1849,"sourceSha256":"52568860751009fbb064e2dddbf6a029c95c15e0d1355fdc655b15288725a21e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a05b86b44e11a30bb224","title":"2025年浙江师范大学心理学院关于接收2026级推荐免试攻读研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:44.905329+00:00"}
